Cell["\<\
A random fibered graph over the 4 \[Times] 4 grid with fibers of 1 to 3 \
vertices. Its base is the grid:\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"a4b8d63b-ad7d-4492-8e01-bd57820c3a38"],

